  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support MoA to prepare National Strategy integrating the SDGs in its National Agricultural Planning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The adoption and implementation of the Updated National Strategy for Agriculture, new Action Plan (2020-2023), new management structure and institutional strengthening action plan by the Ministry of Agriculture (MoA); The submission for approval of the Full Funding Proposal (FFP) by the GCF; The implementation of agricultural statistics related technical and policy instruments to integrate SDGs in the national agricultural planning.</narrative>
  </description>
